Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:34.13,Note,,0,0,0,,(开菊兽[日语]: 巨型野兽)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:37.05,Note,,0,0,0,,(贼鸥[德语]: 猎人)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在我还是孩子的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,每当感觉到渺小和孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever I'd feel small or lonely,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.95,0:00:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我都会抬头看着星星\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd look up at the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,幻想那里存在着生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wondered if there was life up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,后来我才知道我看错了方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out I was looking in the wrong direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,原来外星生命是从太平洋底闯入到我们的世界来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When alien life entered our world...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.23,0:00:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从两个板块缝隙\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was from deep beneath the pacific ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.07,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,从平行宇宙的入口闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fissure between two tectonic plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.90,0:01:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们管那里叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A portal between dimensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.91,0:01:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,缺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}The breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我15岁的时候 第一只怪兽在旧金山登陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was fifteen when the first kaiju made land in San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那个时候 坦克 战斗机 导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time tanks, jets and missiles took it down...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在方圆35公里狂轰滥炸了6天 三座城市毁于一旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}six days and 35 Miles later, three cities were destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.58,0:01:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,数以万计的生命在攻击中丧生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tens of thousands of lives were lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.36,0:02:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为死者建立了公墓 纪念这场仍在继续的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We mourned our dead, memorialized the attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,乱世之伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and moved on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.80,0:02:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,然而 仅仅六个月之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, only six months later,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,第二波攻击发生在马尼拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}the second attack hit manila.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽的酸性血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Female newscaster: The acid factor of the kaiju blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,引发了一种特殊中毒现象 怪兽氓蓝\N{\fnArial\fs30}creates a toxic phenomenon named kaiju blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.31,0:02:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,第三波攻击发生在卡波角\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the third one hit cabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.65,0:02:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,之后是第四波\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,渐渐我们明白了 攻击是不会停止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we learned this was not gonna stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这些仅仅是开始而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一种新型武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed a new weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,世界各国联手调动所有资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world came together, pooling its resources...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,为了打败共同的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and throwing aside old rivalries...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,摈弃前嫌 携手迎战\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the sake of the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,为了对抗怪兽 我们需要创造自己的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}To fight monsters, we created monsters of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,贼鸥计划应运而生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jaeger program was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,起初计划屡试屡败\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were setbacks at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.58,0:02:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,单个驾驶员根本无法负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}The neural load to interface with a jaeger...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,机甲战士的意识传感系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}proved too much for a single pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,于是便开始采用双驾驶员系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}A two-pilot system was implemented.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一个控制左半脑 一个控制右半脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left-hemisphere, right-hemisphere pilot control.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.83,0:03:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们开始获胜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We started winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,机甲战士把怪兽打得落花流水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaegers stopping kaijus everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,出色的驾驶员打造出最强悍的机甲战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the jaegers were only as good as their pilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们像摇滚明星一样到处作秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}So jaeger pilots turned into rock stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,危机变成了宣传话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger turned into propaganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽变成了儿童玩偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaijus into toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最擅长的事就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got really good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.99,0:03:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it all changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.06,0:03:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,危险流浪者向08号塔台 A-42级报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy danger, report to bay 08, level a-42.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽 代号刀锋头 第三代 8700吨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaiju. Code name: Knifehead. Category 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,杨希 快醒醒 缺口有动静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, yancy, wake up! Movement in the breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.17,0:03:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 给我们派活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on! We're being deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.37,0:03:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,第三代怪兽 迄今最大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaiju's a category 3, biggest one yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.25,0:04:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,它的代号是 刀锋头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code name: Knifehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 两点 - 快 快 快 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 2:00. - Go, go, go! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 早上 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A.M.? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,马上要第五只了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifth notch on the belt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.73,0:04:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 贝克特兄弟 时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, beckets. Time for the drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.03,0:04:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 傻小子 - 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, kid. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别瞎得瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,很多年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years before,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会相信哥哥杨希和我会成为英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn't have picked my brother yancy and I for heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,死也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好 让我们打他个片甲不留\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's suit up and kick some ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们天生就不是明星的料\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were never star athletes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,天生也不是拔尖的好学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never at the head of the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可在战斗中我们却是常胜将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we could hold our own in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.62,0:04:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们兄弟俩有一项特长\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it turned out we had a unique skill:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,配合完美的通感\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were drift compatible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,能量缓冲完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,穿戴就绪 准备就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data on helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,数据中转凝胶正全面传输中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data relay gel dispersing in circuitry suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 贝克特兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, becket boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,天童 你还好吗 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tendo, what's happening, my man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.98,0:05:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚上跟艾莉森的约会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd that date with Alison go last night, Mr. choi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她超爱我 可是她男朋友敌视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she loved me. Her boyfriend? Not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.85,0:05:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你早晚会被狂扁一顿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get your ass kicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,男人就该干男人该干的事 兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man's gotta do what a man's gotta do, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,准备投放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engage drop, Mr. choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,准备投放中 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engaging drop, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.76,0:05:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,潘特考斯将军到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshal pentecost on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,检查驾驶舱 准备投放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Securing the conn pod. Gettin' ready to drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,驾驶舱门锁定确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conn pod door lock secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.21,0:06:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,投放准备就绪 各就各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release for drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,释放投放器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy danger ready for the big drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏上场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,开打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,确认结合 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coupling confirmed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,开启驾驶员之间的连线程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engage pilot-to-pilot protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.16,0:06:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,连线开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engaging now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,驾驶员之间连线程序进行中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot-to-pilot connection protocol sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,流浪者启动 六号湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy launch, bay 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,准备完毕 正在校准 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy danger ready and aligned, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我是斯达克·潘特考斯特将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rangers, this is marshal stacker pentecost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,准备神经元对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for neural handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.51,0:07:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,15秒倒计时开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting in 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,14 13\N{\fnArial\fs30}14...13...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,12 11 10\N{\fnArial\fs30}12, 11, 10...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.18,0:07:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好进入我大脑了吗 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to step into my head, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还是你来吧 - 我得尊老爱幼 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, after you. - Age before beauty, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 驾驶员之间连线程序进行中 - 5 4 3\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pilot-to-pilot connection protocol sequence. - ...5, 4, 3...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 神经元对接开始 - 2 1\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neural handshake initiated. - ...2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,通感 贼鸥计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drift. Jaeger tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,起源于国防部高级研究局的战斗机驾驶员神经系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on darpa jet fighter neural systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.57,0:07:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,两个驾驶员 通过记忆实现心智结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two pilots, mind-melding through memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.41,0:07:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一起控制一部巨大的机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the body of a giant machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,结合得越深\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deeper the bond...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.11,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,能力越强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The better you fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,神经元对接信号强烈稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neural handshake strong and holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大脑右半球校准中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right hemisphere is calibrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.59,0:08:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大脑左半球校准中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left hemisphere calibrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,校准完毕 传送中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proofed and transmitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,先生们 你们的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, your orders are...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是守住神奇海岸线 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hold the miracle mile off Anchorage. Copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.11,0:08:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 阿拉斯加湾有一艘航行的民用船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there's still a civilian vessel in the Gulf...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你们保护的是全城两百万人民的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}gentlemen, you're protecting a city of 2 million people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不能为了一艘小船顾此失彼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not risk those lives for a boat that holds 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.85,0:08:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,明白 长官 真够冷血的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Man, that's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我们什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我在你脑子里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,当然知道 一起钓鱼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Then let's go fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,开始大展拳脚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, bro! Put some muscle to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还是管好你自己吧 臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worry about yourself, kiddo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有些时候渺小的人类根本对抗不了上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things you can't fight, acts of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,比如现在暴风雨肆虐 你能做的就是躲避\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see a hurricane coming, you have to get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可一旦你成为了机甲战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when you're in a jaeger,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你就强大到可以和暴风雨对抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}suddenly, you can fight the hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你就有了胜算\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:13.49,Note,,0,0,0,,(阿拉斯加海岸 海岸线10英里)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把笼子拉近 赶快到下面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em tied down and go down below!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快 使劲儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,离陆地还有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far to the mainland?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,离安克雷奇还有7英里 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}7 Miles off Anchorage, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们现在连浅滩都到不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we won't even make it past the shallows!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,东面3英里的那个小岛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that island 3 Miles east?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 两英里了 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! It's two Miles, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一英里了 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-one mile, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,它到底为什么会越来越近\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell can it be getting closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaiju.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快右满舵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harder starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快掉头 快点 越来越近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing it as fast as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.78,0:10:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.55,0:10:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,船只安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 校准扭矩 - 校准\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Adjust the torque! - I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,扭矩锁定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torque locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抓住它了 快 - 开炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get him. Come on. - Shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,炮弹上膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it! I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.71,0:11:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,放电阅读 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discharge reading, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等离子榴弹炮在距海岸线七英里的浅陆架爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plasma Cannon in the shallow shelves 7 Miles off the coastal line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,流浪者 发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy, what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,任务完成 长官 发射两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job's done, sir. Lit it up twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉了第五个敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bagged our fifth kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.02,0:11:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你们违反了我的直接指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disobeyed a direct order!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,向您汇报 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respectfully, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不但拦截了怪兽 还拯救了船上人的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}we intercepted a kaiju and saved everyone on that boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.39,0:11:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,马上回到你们的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to your post, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽的生命迹象在增强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaiju signature rising!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.70,0:12:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,传感器检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensor checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那鬼东西还活着 流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing's still alive, sir. Gipsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是可以读到信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still getting a signature!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.47,0:12:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那怪兽还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kaiju is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,带着渔船赶快离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the boat and get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.65,0:12:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,带着渔船赶快离开现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the boat and get out of there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.42,0:12:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你控制它 罗利 我再给它一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it, Raleigh! I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我被击中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loccent, we're hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.07,0:12:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,左臂失去动力 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left arm's gone cold, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,外壳 外壳被刺穿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hull! It went through the hull!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,罗利听我说 你需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raleigh, listen to me! You need...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,蓄力中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loading.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,第二次发射破坏了所有通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second discharge fried all the comms, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.13,0:14:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting any signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,压力下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pressure dropping!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.67,0:14:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,失去压力 重复 失去压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pressure! Repeat: No pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没有信号 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signatures, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,现在怎么办 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你要紧盯着这个测量仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I want you to keep your eye on that gauge there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这会儿你该知道我在找什么了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you know what I'd like to find?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我在找一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to find a whole ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.15,0:14:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我来这儿就是为了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'd like to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.79,0:14:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.62,0:14:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 就在这儿 就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Right there, right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.02,0:14:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dig!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.23,0:14:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,像是一个旧玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just an old toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从来都挖不到宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never find anything good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.73,0:14:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.17,0:14:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.81,0:15:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我能帮你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,杨希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,杨希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快去找救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Get help, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 撑住 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:05.00,Title,,0,0,0,,《环太平洋》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.83,0:17:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽找到了我们的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kaiju are learning our defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,它们已经适应了 进化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're adapting. Evolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.27,0:17:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,机甲战士被毁的速度高于生产速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're losing jaegers faster than we can build them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,利马城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lima.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,西雅图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.15,0:17:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,海参崴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vladivostok.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.55,0:17:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,第四代怪兽正通过缺口长驱直入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Category 4 kaijus are now coming through the breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你也看得出来 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think even you can see, marshal,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这战略计划已经不管用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is no longer a sound strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.19,0:17:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,随着攻击次数和强度不断增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}The frequency of the attacks has increased.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,贼鸥机甲战士现在已经不再是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jaegers are not the most viable...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.73,0:17:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,最有力的钢铁防线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}line of defense anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这我完全知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,每一个机甲战士倒下就意味着更多的特种兵牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are my rangers that die every time a jaeger falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.47,0:17:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why I'm asking you for one last chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,打断你一下 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, marshal. Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.24,0:17:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 恳求你们 动用我们所有的力量拼死一搏 - 打断你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ...one final assault with everything we've got. - Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,贼鸥计划已经名存实亡了 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jaeger program is dead, marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,另一方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.21,0:17:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,海岸围墙筑造倒是值得考虑的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}the coastal wall program is a promising option.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,全世界都会铭记\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world appreciates...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你的部队所做的贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}all that you and your men have done,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:17:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's over. We will authorize you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,带着剩下的机甲战士退居最后的战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take all remaining jaegers to the last battle station:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,香港\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.59,0:18:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来的八个月我们还会继续资助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're prepared to fund you for the next eight months...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,直到海岸围墙筑造完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the coastal wall is completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,以后我们不会再向你提供资金了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, you will receive no further support.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最终结果 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your answer, marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,最终结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.67,0:18:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.28,0:18:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,西装革履 人模人样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suits and ties, flashy smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就是这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all they are, stacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们自己干\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:39.30,Note,,0,0,0,,("生命之墙" 阿拉斯加州 锡特卡)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:46.39,Note,,0,0,0,,(阿拉斯加-加利福尼亚 怪兽防御墙工程)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,定量供应卡 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ration cards, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.14,0:18:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,都过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一个好消息和一个坏消息 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I got good news and I got bad news, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想先听哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one you wanna hear first?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.32,0:19:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,坏消息是三个人死了 他们昨天在墙头上工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three guys died yesterday working the top of the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.43,0:19:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息是这儿三个空缺职位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good news is, I got three new job openings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,顶昨天死的弟兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top of the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.47,0:19:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 想得到这个工作的人 想吃饱饭的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, who wants to work? Who wants to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我在悉尼为大家报道 今天早些时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am here in Sydney, where earlier today,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.05,0:20:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽发起了新一轮的攻势\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet another kaiju attack took place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.95,0:20:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,体型巨大的第四代怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kaiju, an enormous category 4,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.72,0:20:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,花了不到一小时便攻陷了海岸围墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}broke through the coastal wall in less than an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这一突袭迅速有力得证明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wall of life had been deemed unbreachable...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,生命之墙的形同虚设\N{\fnArial\fs30}by its builders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到底是在建造什么玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell are we even buildin' this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽通过悉尼湾入侵城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}The creature entered the city through Sydney cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That...that thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 几乎没使劲就把墙打烂了 - 讽刺的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- went through the wall like it was nothing. - Ironically, it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,最近宣布退役的机甲战士尤里卡突袭者\N{\fnArial\fs30}the recently decommissioned jaeger, striker Eureka,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.34,0:20:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,驾驶员汉森父子\N{\fnArial\fs30}piloted by herc and Chuck Hansen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.84,0:20:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,最终打败了入侵的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}that finally took the beast down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.74,0:21:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们因为那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, they decommissioned...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,无能的机甲战士 就想叫停贼鸥计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}the jaeger program because of mediocre pilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,太欠考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.51,0:21:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这是突袭者干掉的第十个怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's striker Eureka's tenth kill to date.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,刷新了纪录\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a new record.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.01,0:21:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这里的情况这么糟 你还要坚持去香港吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're still going to Hong Kong, even at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,俗话说军令如山 我不能违抗指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, orders are orders. What else am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.42,0:21:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚刚采访的是查克·汉森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck Hansen, one of the pilots of striker Eureka,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,正是战胜怪兽的尤里卡突袭者的驾驶员之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}the jaeger that took down the kaiju.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,贝克特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. becket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.27,0:21:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 别来无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshal. Looking sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.11,0:21:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.11,0:21:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,五年零四个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years, four months.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,能聊几句吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.65,0:21:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,所有三区的焊工请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, all zone three welders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,到我办公室来说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step into my office, marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,找你可没少花功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me a while to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,安克雷奇市 谢尔顿市 诺姆省\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anchorage, Sheldon point, nome...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:21:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我干的活就是得跟着这堵墙走\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, a man in my position travels with the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.49,0:22:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,混口饭吃而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}chasing shifts to make a livin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.73,0:22:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,找我什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.10,0:22:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了六个月时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've spent the last six months...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.10,0:22:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,去修复激活所有的机甲战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}activating everything I can get my hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.50,0:22:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有一台老机器 编号第三\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an old jaeger, a mark 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.97,0:22:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该知道 它需要一个驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may know it. It needs a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.41,0:22:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你的首选不是我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing I wasn't your first choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.51,0:22:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是我的首选\N{\fnArial\fs30}You amy first choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.15,0:22:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所有驾驶过三号的驾驶员都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the other mark 3 pilots are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.93,0:22:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经无法再接受别人进入我大脑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have anyone else in my head again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.13,0:22:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.37,0:22:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在我哥哥死的时候 和他链接的我也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was still connected to my brother when he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.37,0:22:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我这辈子不想再经历了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go through that again, man, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.01,0:22:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你听过这个说法吗 贝克特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you heard, Mr. becket?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.98,0:22:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,世界末日就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.61,0:22:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,到那个时候你想死在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where would you rather die? !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.02,0:22:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿 还是机甲里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, or in a jaeger? !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:07.07,Note,,0,0,0,,(香港港湾 18点)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.45,0:23:17.45,Note,,0,0,0,,(碎片圆顶-贼鸥基地)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,贝克特先生 这是森麻子小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. becket, this is mako mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.76,0:24:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这儿最聪明的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our brightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.36,0:24:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,她专门负责三号机甲的修复工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also in charge of the mark 3 restoration program.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.93,0:24:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,她亲自为你挑选了配合你的候选人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She personally handpicked your copilot candidates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.77,0:24:23.23,Note,,0,0,0,,他跟我想象的不同
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.01,0:24:27.41,Note,,0,0,0,,更好还是更糟
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.10,0:24:34.70,Note,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉贝克特先生 我听说过很多关于你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.38,0:24:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,稍息\N{\fnArial\fs30}At ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.12,0:24:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我先带你参观一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will tour the facility first...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.06,0:24:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,然后麻子小姐带你去看你的机甲战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then miss mori will show you to your jaeger, Mr. becket.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.59,0:24:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等我们一下 - 别关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait for us, please! - Hold the door, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.30,0:24:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.30,0:24:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,别靠近 怪兽样本是极其罕见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back! Kaiju specimens are extremely rare,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.17,0:24:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以只能看不能摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}so look but don't touch, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.64,0:24:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,贝克特先生 这是我们的研究小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. becket, this is our research team.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.17,0:25:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,戈特利布博士和葛斯勒博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. gottlieb and Dr. geiszler.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.44,0:25:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别 叫我纽顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, call me newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.84,0:25:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我妈会叫我博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only my mother calls me doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.75,0:25:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,赫尔曼 这些都是人类 打个招呼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hermann, these are human beings. Why don't you say hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.01,0:25:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说过 别在别人面前直呼我名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have asked you not to refer to me by my first name around others.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.62,0:25:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个有十年辉煌成就的优秀博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a doctor with over 10 years decorated experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.49,0:25:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 不 对 - 十年辉煌成就的优秀博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no, yes. I have ten... - 10 years of experience, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.85,0:25:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.69,0:25:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.69,0:25:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,纹的是雅玛拉奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that, yamarashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.26,0:25:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你说这只小怪兽 对 你挺有眼力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this little kaiju? Yeah, you got a good eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.16,0:25:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我和我哥哥在2017年干掉它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother and I took him down in 2017.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.33,0:25:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,它可是第三代怪兽里最大个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he was one of the biggest category 3s ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.20,0:25:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道它重达2500吨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was 2, 500 tons of awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.04,0:25:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你心里是不是觉得很落伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or awful. You know, whatever you wanna call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.44,0:25:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你千万别见怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, please excuse him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.71,0:25:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个怪兽粉丝 他超爱怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a kaiju groupie. He loves...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.45,0:25:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 赫尔曼 我不爱它们好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}shut up, hermann, I don't love them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.05,0:25:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我研究它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I study them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.52,0:25:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我和普通人想法不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}And unlike most people,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望哪天能看看活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see one alive and up close one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.49,0:25:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 你会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.66,0:25:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你所谓的研究部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's your research division?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.86,0:25:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,今非昔比了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.96,0:26:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不再是军队了 贝克特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not an army anymore, Mr. becket.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.64,0:26:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在是地下组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎加入碎片圆顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the shatterdome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,战事钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}War clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.86,0:26:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,每次怪兽进攻我们都会重置时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We reset it after every kaiju attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.06,0:26:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,以此警醒大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps everyone focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.40,0:26:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在进攻次数越来越频繁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The frequency of attacks is accelerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.77,0:26:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,下次重置在什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long till the next reset?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.60,0:26:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一周后 如果够幸运的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week, if we're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.00,0:26:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我的专家们认为 用不了一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}My experts believe there'll be a kaiju attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.11,0:26:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就会有一次怪兽进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}even before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.04,0:26:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这个基地的五个港湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}This complex used to lodge 30 jaegers...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.38,0:26:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经容得下三十个机甲战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}in five bays just like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.45,0:26:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只剩下四个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we only have four jaegers left.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.22,0:26:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真不知道情况这么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know it was this bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.19,0:26:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,确实很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,红色暴风 中国产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crimson typhoon, China.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.42,0:26:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,最伟大的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.79,0:26:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在常州组装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assembled in changzhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.39,0:27:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,钛金打造纯度极高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full titanium core, no alloys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.56,0:27:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,每条肌带由50台柴油引擎组成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty diesel engines per muscle strand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.93,0:27:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,百发百中的杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deadly, precise fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.47,0:27:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,她由唐氏兄弟驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's piloted by the wei tang brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.03,0:27:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是三胞胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Triplets.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.90,0:27:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,本地人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.60,0:27:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们七次击溃了敌人 成功保卫了香港湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've successfully defended Hong Kong port seven times.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.71,0:27:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们用的是雷云战术\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use the thundercloud formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.91,0:27:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 三手臂技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Triple-arm technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.88,0:27:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,非常有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.05,0:27:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙是T90型最后一部\N{\fnArial\fs30}That tank, last of the t-90s.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.89,0:27:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,切尔诺阿尔法 第一代里一号机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cherno Alpha. First generation mark 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.12,0:27:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,目前仍在服役的最重最老的机甲战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heaviest and oldest jaeger in the service.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.76,0:27:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可别小看它 它是最残忍的战争机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}But make no mistake, Mr. becket, it's a brutal war machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.99,0:27:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those two,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.50,0:27:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就是萨尔莎和阿历克西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha and aleksis kaidanovksy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.46,0:27:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've heard of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.90,0:27:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,负责巡逻西伯利亚海岸围墙的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perimeter patrol, siberian wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.93,0:27:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在他们的看守下 六年没出过状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}On theiwatch it stayed unbreached for six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.67,0:27:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,六年啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.09,0:28:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,赫克 查克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herc! Chuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.76,0:28:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,先生们 欢迎来到香港\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, welcome to Hong Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.69,0:28:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,等我一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.96,0:28:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克斯 到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.00,0:28:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.17,0:28:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别想讨好麻子小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't drool all over miss mori. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.37,0:28:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,它每次看见美女 就哈喇子满地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sees a pretty girl and he gets all wound up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.14,0:28:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,罗利 这是赫克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raleigh, this is Hercules Hansen,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.87,0:28:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一起携手走过辉煌第一代机甲的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}an old friend from the mark 1 glory days.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.54,0:28:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识你 伙计 我们一起打过仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you, mate. We rode together before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.27,0:28:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,六年前 我和我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did, sir. Six years ago. My brother and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.64,0:28:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是三组一起出动的任务 - 对 在马尼拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was a three jaeger team drop. - That's right. Manila.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.85,0:28:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你哥哥的事情我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.18,0:28:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.85,0:28:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,赫克和他儿子查克是先遣组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herc and his son Chuck'll be runnin' point...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.19,0:28:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,驾驶突袭者\N{\fnArial\fs30}usin' striker Eureka.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.52,0:28:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是全世界速度最快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fastest jaeger in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.06,0:28:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是第一个 也是最后一个五代机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}First and last of the mark 5s.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.72,0:28:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,澳大利亚刚让它退役没几天后 悉尼就沦陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Australia decommissioned it a day before the Sydney attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.56,0:28:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 幸好我们又在这儿集结了 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, it was lucky we were still around. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.96,0:28:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,现在它是计划成败的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's runnin' point for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.16,0:28:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,计划成败的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, running point on what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.56,0:28:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没说让我来这儿干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't told me what I'm doing here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.33,0:28:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们计划消灭缺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going for the breach, Mr. becket.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.80,0:28:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们打算捆上一个2400磅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna strap a 2,400 pound...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,热核炸弹在突袭者背上\N{\fnArial\fs30}thermonuclear warhead to striker's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.91,0:28:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸威力等同于120万吨烈性炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detonate an equivalent of 1. 2 million tons of tnt,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.04,0:29:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你和另外两个机甲战士负责掩护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you and two other jaegers'll be runnin' defense for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.81,0:29:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是转入地下了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought we were the resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.38,0:29:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哪儿弄来那么多炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get something that big?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.32,0:29:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看见刚才的俄国人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the Russians back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.49,0:29:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can get us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.22,0:29:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,赫克 来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herc, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.22,0:29:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.59,0:29:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.83,0:29:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我带你去见你的机甲战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you to your jaeger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.76,0:29:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子小姐 等一下好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss mori, will you give me a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.40,0:29:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshal!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.93,0:29:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以前进攻过那个缺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we've hit the breach before.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.23,0:29:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没成功 没有东西能攻破它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't work. Nothing goes through.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.60,0:29:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么这么自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.90,0:29:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我制定了个计划 需要你加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a plan. I need you ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.51,0:29:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.84,0:29:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 赫克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, herc!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.88,0:29:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克斯 给我过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.85,0:29:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,17小组 听到广播后请到五层来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crew 17, please report to the fifth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.28,0:29:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,〇减二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero minus two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.95,0:29:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,XY减二\N{\fnArial\fs30}XY minus two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.89,0:29:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,R E Q\N{\fnArial\fs30}R-e-q.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.26,0:29:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.56,0:29:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽进攻每次间隔24周\N{\fnArial\fs30}the kaiju attacks were spaced by 24 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.13,0:29:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,然后12周 6周 然后是每次2周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then 12, then 6, then every 2 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.13,0:29:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,上一次在悉尼进攻仅隔1周\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last one in Sydney was a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.40,0:29:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,四天内 我们可能每八小时就能看见一头怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}In four days, we could be seeing a kaiju every eight hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.94,0:29:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,直到它们每四分钟就进攻一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}until they are coming every four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.61,0:30:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 七天内它们可能同时在两个地方发动进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshal, we should witness a double event within seven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.64,0:30:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,戈特利布先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gottlieb,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.11,0:30:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我将要投下2400磅的热核炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm to drop a 2, 400 pound thermonuclear bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.21,0:30:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不允许仅仅是可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need more than a prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.12,0:30:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 还真是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, that's a problem, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.78,0:30:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,因为对于未来的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}because see, he actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.49,0:30:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他能给出的只有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't give you anything more than a prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.65,0:30:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别把怪兽内脏扔到我这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kaiju entrails over my side of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.79,0:30:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我的原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.09,0:30:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,每天血淋呼啦的 没完没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every bloody day. It's incessant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.29,0:30:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 回到重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gents! On point.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.13,0:30:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,数字是不会撒谎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numbers do not lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.60,0:30:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,政治 诗歌 承诺 这些才是谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Politics and poetry, promises, these are lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.40,0:30:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,数字真实可信的程度就跟上帝的手稿一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numbers are as close as we get to the handwriting of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.97,0:30:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.30,0:30:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你能让我说完吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you give me a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.01,0:30:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,将会同时出现两只怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be a double event...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.61,0:30:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,之后很快就会出现三只\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then, shortly thereafter, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.61,0:30:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是四只\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then four.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.48,0:30:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. Alas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.28,0:30:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 但还有一个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where the good news comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.48,0:30:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我们的宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is our universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.09,0:30:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是它们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and here is theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.96,0:30:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,而这里是被称作喉舌的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is what we call "the throat,"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.03,0:30:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是缺口和我们之间的通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The passage between the breach and us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.13,0:30:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道它的本质是原子能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that it's atomic in nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.03,0:31:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我的预测是 加剧的攻击频率\N{\fnArial\fs30}I predict that the increased traffic...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.03,0:31:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,会强迫缺口稳固下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}will force the breach to stabilize...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.54,0:31:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,保持状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}and remain open long enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.37,0:31:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,直到让炸药通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get the device through...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.61,0:31:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,然后摧毁这个通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And collapse its structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.94,0:31:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我想我必须得插点话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and that's where I gotta chime in...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.01,0:31:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,因为说真的 我是不会进到那种地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because, really, I wouldn't wanna go in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.38,0:31:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在我什么都不能确定的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that limited amount of information.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.52,0:31:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你胆小如鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newton, don't embarrass yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.65,0:31:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 就听我说几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I was tryin' to say. Just hear me out for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.95,0:31:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,几秒钟就够 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a second, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.52,0:31:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我们把怪兽划为不同的种类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we judge the kaiju on a category system?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.16,0:31:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这只和另一只完全不同 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because each one is completely different from the next, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.46,0:31:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都知道 有些怪兽是尖的 有些像只鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what I'm saying? One looks like a shark and one looks like a fish...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.36,0:31:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,葛斯勒博士 能不能谈重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. geiszler. Just get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.53,0:31:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,对 重点是我不认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. The point is I don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.47,0:31:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,它们都是完全不同的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're all completely different after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.00,0:31:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我选取了一些怪兽样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are some samples I collected, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.87,0:31:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这款样本是悉尼的那只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this one here was harvested in Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.07,0:31:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,而这块来自马尼拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this was harvested in manila.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.68,0:31:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是6年前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}6 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.91,0:31:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,它们具有完全吻合的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have the same exact DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.75,0:31:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,无性繁殖\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're clones.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.98,0:31:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我看他的重点就是他自己 已经走火入魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is the point where he goes completely crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.99,0:31:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这些怪兽身上有太多我们不能理解的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so much more to the kaiju than we understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.19,0:32:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只能从表面上来解释一些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've really only scratched the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.93,0:32:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怪兽大脑的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a piece of a kaiju's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.23,0:32:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不幸的是它被损坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, unfortunately, it's damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.40,0:32:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,而且很虚弱 但它仍然是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little bit weak. But it's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.20,0:32:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我进入它的神经元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I think I can tap into it...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.77,0:32:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,运用将两个机甲驾驶员的\N{\fnArial\fs30}using the same technology...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.40,0:32:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,神经桥接相同的技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}that allows the two jaeger pilots to share a neural bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.71,0:32:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.44,0:32:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我就可以告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could tell you exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.58,0:32:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,准确的穿越裂缝的方法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to get through the breach yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.35,0:32:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你的建议是让我们和怪兽进行通感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're suggesting that we initiate a drift with a kaiju?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.95,0:32:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 不是和整只怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No, no. Not like a whole kaiju, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.12,0:32:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只是和它这一小部分的脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}just a tiny piece of its brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.89,0:32:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这种强烈神经刺激 恐怕人类承受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The neural surge would be too much for the human brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.05,0:32:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说得没错 - 不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I agree. - I don't agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.52,0:32:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,戈特利布 整理好研究数据尽快交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gottlieb, I'd like your data on my desk asap.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.53,0:32:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.06,0:32:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是他的研究也太… - 谢谢你 纽顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, but his is so... - thank you, newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.46,0:32:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,先生们 这项研究会让你们大吃一惊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, now, this is the most amazing thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.77,0:32:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,纽顿 我知道你渴望证明自己是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newton, I know that you're desperate to be right...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.24,0:32:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这样也不枉费你作为怪兽粉丝的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you've not wasted your life being a kaiju groupie,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.94,0:32:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但你那套空有其表\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.54,0:32:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对有用的 赫尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is going to work, hermann.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.07,0:32:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我还想跟你说点别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll tell you something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.78,0:32:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,机会总给勇敢的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune favors the brave, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.88,0:32:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你都听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.08,0:32:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他们绝对不会给你任何实验器材的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't give you the equipment...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.81,0:32:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你会小命不保\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even if they did, you'd kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.98,0:33:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也许功成名就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd be a rock star.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.22,0:33:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她就在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.46,0:33:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.56,0:33:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.23,0:33:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,危险流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.30,0:33:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 她可真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, it's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.41,0:33:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去跟新的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks like new.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.84,0:33:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,比新的更棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than new.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.51,0:33:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她拥有双核心核反应器\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a double-core nuclear reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.15,0:33:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她现在是独一无二的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's one of a kind now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.45,0:33:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She always was.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.85,0:33:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢你的战士吗 贝克特伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you like your ride, becket boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.52,0:33:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,固体铁质外壳 超纯对精钢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solid iron hull, no alloys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.16,0:33:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,每条肌带上有40个引擎机组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty engine blocks per muscle strands.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.36,0:33:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,四肢配备超级控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyper-torque driver for every limb...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.29,0:33:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,全新的系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a new fluid synapse system.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.13,0:33:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.46,0:33:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,天童\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.67,0:33:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.67,0:33:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你我也很开心 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you too, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.84,0:33:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就像回到了旧时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.81,0:33:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's your story?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.34,0:33:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,想重振机甲战士雄风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restoring old jaegers,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.88,0:33:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助我这老树开新花\N{\fnArial\fs30}showing has-beens like me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.31,0:34:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不会是因为这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can't be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.05,0:34:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你是驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.02,0:34:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不 还不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.05,0:34:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但我特别想成为驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wanna be one, more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.12,0:34:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你的模拟器成绩是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your simulator score?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.66,0:34:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,52投 51杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}51 drops, 51 kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.96,0:34:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 那很棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.33,0:34:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可你明天却没在候选之列\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not one of the candidates tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.80,0:34:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.57,0:34:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,将军自有他的道理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The marshal has his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.17,0:34:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 他总是对的 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he always does, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.30,0:34:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,可51次的记录 我想不出他有什么理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with 51 kills, I can't imagine what they could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.47,0:34:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你能喜欢我挑选的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you approve of my choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.58,0:34:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是根据的你的战斗技巧和策略认真挑选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've studied your fighting techniques and strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.08,0:34:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是阿拉斯加那次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even...Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.48,0:34:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.55,0:34:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你不受控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.22,0:34:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你经常有偏离\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a habit of deviating...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,既定战略战术的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}from standard combat techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.53,0:34:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你让你和你的战友陷入危机和伤害中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take risks and injure yourself and your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.83,0:34:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认为你是这次行动的最佳人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you're the right man for this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.70,0:35:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.94,0:35:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你的诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.34,0:35:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.91,0:35:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可有一天你若成为驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one day, when you're a pilot,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.08,0:35:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你亲眼看到了战场 你就得下决策\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna see that in combat you make decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.29,0:35:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你也必须承担得起一切的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have to live with the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.06,0:35:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我坚持的理念\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.13,0:35:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,候选人都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The candidates are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.60,0:35:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,选拔赛马上就要开始了 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will commence the trials immediately, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.96,0:35:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 但还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. - But there is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.73,0:36:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们… - 麻子 我们已经讨论过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We... - mako, we have talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.00,0:36:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不需要再讨论了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not be talking about it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.60,0:36:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.07,0:36:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应过我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.89,0:36:10.89,Note,,0,0,0,,我应该跟他一起驾驶流浪者
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.96,0:36:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.98,0:36:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇 就像撕开愈合的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vengeance is like an open wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.45,0:36:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能带着这样的情绪参加通感行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot take that level of emotion into the drift.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.12,0:36:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,为了我的家人 我需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my family, I need...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.38,0:36:23.88,Note,,0,0,0,,你需要更多时间
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.37,0:36:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,罗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.54,0:36:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come sit with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.87,0:36:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 谢谢 我坐上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.64,0:36:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 这桌有的是地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, come on, there's plenty of room at our table.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.14,0:36:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,很久没见过面包了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen bread in awhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.81,0:36:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,香港\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.68,0:36:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,开放港口好处多 不限制配额\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty of an open port, no rationing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.82,0:36:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有土豆 豌豆 荷兰豆 很正点的肉卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got potatoes, peas, sweet beans, decent meat loaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.05,0:36:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,把土豆递给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass the potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.72,0:36:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,罗利 我儿子查克 也是我的副驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raleigh, this is my son, Chuck. He's my copilot now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.39,0:37:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是我的副驾驶 对吧 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's more my copilot, right, dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.96,0:37:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你就是那个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're the guy, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.40,0:37:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那个带着一副老掉牙的蒸汽机引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the guy who's gonna run defense for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.23,0:37:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,负责掩护我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that old rust bucket of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.83,0:37:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是计划 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the plan. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.30,0:37:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,雷利 你最后驾驶是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when was the last time you jockeyed, ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.74,0:37:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,大概五年前吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}About five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.14,0:37:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这五年你都在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you been doin' for five years?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.98,0:37:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是很重要的事情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something pretty important, I reckon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.71,0:37:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我在建筑工地干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.05,0:37:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 不赖嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.35,0:37:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是太有用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's really useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.65,0:37:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那你打仗的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know, we get into a fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.09,0:37:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可以给我造一条逃跑之路了 雷利\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can build our way out of it, eh, ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.82,0:37:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫罗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Raleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.92,0:37:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.59,0:37:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 也许你是将军的好牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're pentecost's bright idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.56,0:37:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们家老爷子好像也挺喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old man, he seems to like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.66,0:37:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但像你这样的人只会拖后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's guys like you who brought down the jaeger program.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.07,0:37:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说 你是个累赘 你跟不上我的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me, you're dead weight. You slow me down,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.54,0:37:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我甩你就像甩一袋怪兽屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna drop you like a sack of kaiju shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.57,0:37:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,回头见 罗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you around, Raleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.08,0:37:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,走 麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.71,0:37:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要怪就怪我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can blame me for that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.38,0:37:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,养不教父之过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've raised him on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.88,0:37:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直很出色\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a smart kid, but I never knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.72,0:38:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,出色到我不知道该拥抱他还是教训他\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether to give him a hug or a kick in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.46,0:38:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我直言 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}With respect, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.89,0:38:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候该赏罚分明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure which one he needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.22,0:38:11.22,Note,,0,0,0,,(候选人选拔赛 6点)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.80,0:38:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,比分是4比0\N{\fnArial\fs30}4 points to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.58,0:38:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是4比1\N{\fnArial\fs30}4 points to 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.33,0:38:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,比分是4比2\N{\fnArial\fs30}4 points to 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.30,0:38:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.17,0:38:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你不喜欢他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.94,0:38:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是你亲自挑选的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you selected them personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.17,0:38:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.27,0:38:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,每次对打结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time a match ends...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.74,0:38:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你都是这副表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}you make this little gesture,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.68,0:39:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好像对他们的表现很不满意一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you're critical of their performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.35,0:39:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不是他们的表现 是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not their performance, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.35,0:39:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的打斗策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gambit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.15,0:39:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你不需要用这么多招数就已经可以打败他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have taken all of them two moves earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.62,0:39:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.92,0:39:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.02,0:39:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那就改变比赛规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we change this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.96,0:39:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,让她来试试怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout we give her a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.03,0:39:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.50,0:39:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要严格按照参赛名单来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stick to the cadet list we have, ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.77,0:39:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只有具有通感能力的候选人才能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only candidates with drift compatibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.93,0:39:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我就具备 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I have, marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.50,0:39:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子 这不仅仅需要神经连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako, this is not only about a neural connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.17,0:39:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,物理相容性也很需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's also about a physical compatibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.81,0:39:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, marshal?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.51,0:39:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你不认为你的这位得意门生能打得过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think your brightest can cut it in the ring with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.71,0:39:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.99,0:39:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,四招之内制胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four strikes marks a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.89,0:39:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要记住 一切要以相容为主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, it's about compatibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.96,0:39:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是对话 不是打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dialogue, not a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.73,0:39:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 我不会迁就你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not gonna dial down my moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.87,0:39:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.50,0:40:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会迁就你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then neither will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.49,0:40:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,1比0\N{\fnArial\fs30}1-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.73,0:40:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,1比1\N{\fnArial\fs30}1-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.20,0:40:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,2比1 集中注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}2-1. Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.57,0:40:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,2比2\N{\fnArial\fs30}2-2.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.71,0:40:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,最好小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.42,0:40:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,3比2\N{\fnArial\fs30}3-2.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.79,0:40:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子小姐 控制情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mori-San.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.62,0:41:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.65,0:41:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到需要的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen what I need to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.06,0:41:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.39,0:41:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是我的副驾驶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my copilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.96,0:41:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这是行不通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.46,0:41:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.90,0:41:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我有权决定 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I said so, Mr. becket.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.73,0:41:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经做好了决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.60,0:41:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,两小时后岛碎片圆顶报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report to the shatterdome in two hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.23,0:41:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候就知道谁是你的副驾驶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find out who your copilot will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.75,0:41:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.32,0:41:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子 这到底是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was all that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.46,0:42:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是随便想想的 你能感觉到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm not crazy. You felt it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.26,0:42:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之间存在通感\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are drift compatible.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.59,0:42:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你这么支持我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for standing up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.50,0:42:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我想你没办法改变他的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is nothing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.34,0:42:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.54,0:42:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.48,0:42:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能 别怕 我知道你想成为一个驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on. I thought you wanted to be a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.98,0:42:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子 这是值得争取的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako, this is worth fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.98,0:42:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不需要事事听他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to just obey him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.52,0:42:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不是唯命是从的人 贝克特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not obedience, Mr. becket.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.99,0:42:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一种尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.40,0:42:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能告诉我 到底是什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you at least tell me what his problem is?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.42,0:43:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,悉尼事件后的短短几日\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the wake of the Sydney incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.16,0:43:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,生命之墙计划被证明形同虚设\N{\fnArial\fs30}which showed the ineffective nature of the wall of life program,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.26,0:43:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,公众开始质疑政府的真正动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}many are questioning the government's motives...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.20,0:43:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们到底为什么无故中断贼鸥计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wondering why the jaeger program has been discontinued.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.83,0:43:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,民众的大规模暴动游行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riots have erupted along the coastlines...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.07,0:43:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在环太平洋海岸线附近多个城市爆发\N{\fnArial\fs30}of several pan pacific cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.84,0:43:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在已经迁移了数百万灾民和物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have now relocated millions of civilians...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.38,0:43:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,安全地带已选在离内陆约500公里的某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}and supplies 300 Miles inland to the safe zones.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.95,0:43:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,安全地带 那是个富人和权贵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe zones? For the rich and powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.91,0:43:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这些普通民众呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the rest of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.18,0:43:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快回答我们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.42,0:43:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信生命之墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe the wall of life...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.19,0:43:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,依旧是目前我们最大的保障\N{\fnArial\fs30}is still our best option at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.85,0:43:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就此事我能说的只有这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's all I'm gonna say on the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.69,0:43:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than...thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.73,0:43:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽人类通感测试第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaiju/human drift experiment, take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.27,0:43:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 大脑残片是前额叶\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh... the brain segment is the frontal lobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.64,0:43:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, chances are...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.14,0:43:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,由于残缺严重无法实现通感\N{\fnArial\fs30}The segment's far too damaged to drift with.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.71,0:43:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,再说点题外话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unscientific aside:
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.08,0:44:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,赫尔曼 无论你听到这些也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hermann, if you're listening to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.75,0:44:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,还是我仍然活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, I'm either alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.28,0:44:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,并且证明我的实验奏效也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've proven what I've just done works...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.32,0:44:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何我都赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case, ha, I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.62,0:44:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我死了 那也全都是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'm dead and I'd like you to know that it's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.42,0:44:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really is, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.09,0:44:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,激我这么干的 我做鬼也不放过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drove me to this. In which case, ha, I also won.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.56,0:44:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,温柔一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.10,0:44:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,倒计时 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going in in three...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.27,0:44:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.57,0:44:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.90,0:44:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.16,0:44:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,纽顿 纽顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newton. Newton!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.53,0:44:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.50,0:45:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,危险流浪者神经测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy danger neural test...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.71,0:45:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,将在20分钟后开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}commencing in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.05,0:45:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,危险流浪者神经测试将在20分钟后开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy danger neural test commencing in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.12,0:45:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,危险流浪者神经测试将在20分钟后开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy danger neural test commencing in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.20,0:45:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我能进来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. May I come in, mako?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.50,0:45:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,所有机组成员到餐厅报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}All pilots report to mess hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.74,0:45:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很久很久以前 我曾给过你一个承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time ago, I made you a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.76,0:45:42.88,Note,,0,0,0,,准备上场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.70,0:45:47.69,Note,,0,0,0,,(危险流浪者 "试运行" 8点)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.69,0:45:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这些信号传送器用不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These transmitters are non-operative.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.65,0:45:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,得换掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need them replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.43,0:45:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,设置机甲测试模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Setting harness for test mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.66,0:46:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,等待副驾驶员加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for second pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.94,0:46:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,两位驾驶员进舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two pilots onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.71,0:46:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不介意的话 我想站这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take this side if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.61,0:46:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我的左臂曾经受过伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}My left arm's kinda shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.35,0:46:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.25,0:46:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想问我点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.29,0:46:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没必要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No point.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.69,0:46:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,五分钟后你会进入我大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}In five minutes you're gonna be inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.53,0:46:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,衣服很适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.43,0:46:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,驾驶员已就位 准备连线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilots onboard and ready to connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.23,0:46:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,准备神经元对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for neural handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.97,0:46:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,开始神经元对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiating neural handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.71,0:46:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我们现在不是在模拟器上 麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not in the simulator now, mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.55,0:46:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一定记住 千万不要追赶兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, don't chase the rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.15,0:46:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,兔子就是随机读取脑神经元触发物的缩写\N{\fnArial\fs30}Random access brain impulse triggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.62,0:46:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.05,0:46:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就让它们随意倾泻 别阻碍它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let 'em flow, don't latch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.32,0:46:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要忽略它们 保持通感状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tune 'em out. Stay in the drift.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.29,0:46:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,通感是无声的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drift is silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.72,0:47:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,神经元接口开始通感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neural interface drift initiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.80,0:47:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,看 罗利 那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Raleigh! Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.51,0:47:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.28,0:47:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,罗利 听我说 罗利 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raleigh, listen to me! Raleigh, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.18,0:47:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,大脑右半球已校准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right hemisphere calibrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.42,0:47:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,大脑左半球已校准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left hemisphere calibrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.59,0:47:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,准备激活机甲战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to activate the jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.59,0:47:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 流浪者 校准得还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, gipsy. Lining up nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.63,0:47:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,最好现在就准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.30,0:47:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,驾驶员与机甲战士完成连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot to jaeger connection complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.70,0:47:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshal! Marshal!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.94,0:47:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我有话要跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.17,0:47:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不行 戈特利布先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, Mr. gottlieb.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.64,0:47:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该明白此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you can appreciate...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.98,0:47:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说意义重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}how important this moment is to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.38,0:47:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,纽顿用废物创建出了神经桥梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newton created a neural bridge...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.35,0:47:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,实现了与怪兽通感\N{\fnArial\fs30}from garbage and drifted with a kaiju.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.82,0:48:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现他的时候 他瘫倒在那里 看起来晕了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found him prone, and he's sort of dazed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.06,0:48:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't exactly know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.03,0:48:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你能成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.00,0:48:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你做到了 你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you did. Well, what'd you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.83,0:48:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一点头脑的碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it was only a fragment of a brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.13,0:48:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我能看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so really all I was able to get was, like, a series...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.70,0:48:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一连串的图像或者感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}of, uh, images or... or impressions. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.07,0:48:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你一次又一次不停眨眼时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like when you blink your eyes over and over and over again...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.21,0:48:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,看到的东西一帧一帧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all you really see are, like, frames.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.68,0:48:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,静止图像 那就像是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, it was emotional in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.88,0:48:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,纽顿 好了 纽顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newton, Newton. Okay, Newton.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.98,0:48:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是… - 纽顿看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was so... - Newton, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.65,0:48:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,现在慢慢地 要详细地告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I want you to take your time and be very specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.65,0:48:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.19,0:48:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.72,0:48:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.23,0:48:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,它们只是单纯地受兽性驱使\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're just following some sort of animalistic urge,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.99,0:48:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是狩猎和采集\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, just hunting and gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.43,0:48:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得它们是奉命攻击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think they're attacking us under orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.73,0:48:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.10,0:48:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么不可能 - 这绝对不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that impossible? - It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.00,0:48:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这不可能 你是在乱猜测 - 你为什么不跟怪兽通感试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because... you know what? - Why don't you drift with a kaiju? !
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.70,0:48:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你 闭上嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.40,0:48:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.77,0:48:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你 接着说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.54,0:49:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这些怪兽 它们的主人 是殖民者\N{\fnArial\fs30}These beings, these masters, they're colonists.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.05,0:49:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们掌握这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}They overtake worlds. They just...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.62,0:49:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,等消耗尽一切后\N{\fnArial\fs30}they just consume them and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.29,0:49:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,接着寻找下一个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, they move on to the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.79,0:49:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们以前来过这里 抱着试试看的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they've been here before in sort of a trial run.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.69,0:49:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那是在恐龙时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.06,0:49:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但那时的空气并不适合他们生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the atmosphere wasn't conducive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.36,0:49:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他们回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they waited it out. And they waited it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.93,0:49:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,现在臭氧枯竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, you know, with ozone depletion,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.86,0:49:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一氧化碳升高 水被污染\N{\fnArial\fs30}and carbon monoxide, polluted waters...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.77,0:49:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,简直就是为它们准备了大餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, we've practically terraformed it for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.97,0:49:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,所以它们回来了 他们喜欢这环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause now they're coming back, and it's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.27,0:49:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,第一波只是兽猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the first wave, that was just the hounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.27,0:49:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一代到四代都不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Categories 1 through 4, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.04,0:49:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的目的就是进攻人口最稠密的区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their sole purpose was to aim for the populated areas...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.88,0:49:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,消灭我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take out the vermin us!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.24,0:49:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,第二波才是灭杀者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second wave, that is the exterminators.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.05,0:49:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们彻底收拾干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they will finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.98,0:49:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 地球的新房客进驻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, the new tenants will take possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.42,0:49:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是 两只不同的怪兽身上提取的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the reason that I found the identical DNA...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.82,0:49:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是一模一样的 因为它们是克隆出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the two separate kaiju organs is because they are grown!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.79,0:49:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,纽顿 我需要你再做一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newton, I need you to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.39,0:49:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要更多的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need more information.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.10,0:49:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法再做一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? I can't... I can'tdo it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.30,0:49:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 除非你能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...I mean, not unless you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.93,0:49:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一个活着的怪兽大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}a fresh kaiju brain lying around.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.57,0:50:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.48,0:50:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.78,0:50:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他总算还记得怎么开动它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he remembers how to turn it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.02,0:50:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 放尊重点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi, show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.42,0:50:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他哥哥死了以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When his brother died,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.92,0:50:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他独自带着机甲回到基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}he got the jaeger back to shore on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.46,0:50:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,在他之前我只见过一个人能做到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known one other pilot's been able to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.46,0:50:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该知道有些人的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there are certain individuals...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.19,0:50:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是专门保留和开发\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose business is the preservation...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.00,0:50:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,各种怪兽的残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and exploitation of kaiju remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.76,0:50:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 对 没错 应该是黑市交易 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right, black market dealers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.80,0:50:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他们几个小时就能搞定一笔买卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. They're in and out in a matter of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.94,0:50:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们中和血液中的酸性毒物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They neutralize the acidic factor of the blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.64,0:50:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,换取他们想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they harvest what they need.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.64,0:50:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人叫汉尼拔·周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this guy, this is Hannibal chau.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.88,0:50:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他在亚洲专做怪兽的黑市交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}He runs the kaiju black market here in Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.81,0:50:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们资金紧缺的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When our funding ran out,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.51,0:50:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,曾找过他帮忙 作为回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}we turned to him for help, and in return,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.18,0:50:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我给他各地区的怪兽残骸回收专有权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave him exclusive rights to all kaiju remains in the region.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.72,0:50:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你干过这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.95,0:50:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,战争进入尾声了 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last days of war, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.82,0:50:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在芳路和图街交口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the corner of fong and tull.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.02,0:50:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,给他们这个名片 寻找这个标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show them that card. Look for that symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.62,0:50:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但你要谨记 千万不能信任他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a word to the wise, do not trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.86,0:51:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,连接校准完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calibration complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.34,0:51:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,外壳 外壳被刺穿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hull! It went through the hull!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.54,0:51:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,罗利 听我说 你需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raleigh, listen to me! You need...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.74,0:51:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,驾驶员连接失准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot out of alignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.74,0:51:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,两人都失准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both out of alignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.18,0:51:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,都失准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.55,0:51:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,都失准 流浪者 流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of them. Gipsy, gipsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.02,0:51:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你们失准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of alignment!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.52,0:51:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个都失准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are both out of alignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.72,0:51:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事 我能控制住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Just let me control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.22,0:51:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,两名驾驶员 连接失准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot two, out of alignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.06,0:51:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你稳定下来了 但麻子小姐完全失准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stabilizing. But mako is way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.72,0:51:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子 她开始追赶兔子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako. She's starting to chase the rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.49,0:51:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子 别被记忆困住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako, don't get stuck in a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.86,0:51:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,和我在一起 回到现实中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me. Stay in the now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.70,0:51:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,别进入任何一段记忆中去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't engage in a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.37,0:51:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.07,0:51:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.40,0:51:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.00,0:51:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.59,0:52:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.93,0:52:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.95,0:53:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.92,0:53:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是一段记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.32,0:53:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.55,0:53:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,武器系统启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons system engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.38,0:53:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,等离子榴弹炮充电中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plasma Cannon powering up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.19,0:53:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.70,0:53:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,武器系统启动了 打开防备装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapon system engaged! Go to fail-safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.97,0:53:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,自动装置没反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fail-safe not responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.34,0:53:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,神经封阻系统故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a problem with the neural blocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.14,0:53:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子的记忆通感太强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her connection's way too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.84,0:53:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 充电完成 - 麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fully charged. - Mako!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.21,0:54:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子 快听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.15,0:54:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是一段记忆 这不是现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a memory. None of it is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.68,0:54:07.38,Note,,0,0,0,,所有人都撤离 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.68,0:54:09.38,Note,,0,0,0,,所有人都撤离 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.90,0:54:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,电源线 电源线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power line! The power line!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.77,0:54:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快拔掉电源线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the main power line!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.56,0:54:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快拔掉电源线 让他们离线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them offline! Take them offline!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.79,0:54:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,已经拔掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.60,0:55:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,武器系统取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapon system disengaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.48,0:55:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.22,0:55:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,神经元连接训练取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neural bridge exercise invalid.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.32,0:55:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.29,0:55:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,通感关联终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drift sequence terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.50,0:55:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是否需要再试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.14,0:55:30.14,Note,,0,0,0,,(香港 贫民区)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.16,0:55:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.78,0:56:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pss-psst.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.05,0:56:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是想买怪兽骨粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You looking for some kaiju bone powder?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.79,0:56:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,骨粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.29,0:56:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽骨粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some bone powder?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.69,0:56:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我要那些干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, why would I want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.79,0:56:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,壮阳 效果奇佳 我自己都用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Male potency. I take it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.70,0:56:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 明白了 不过 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. Uh, no, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.70,0:56:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我要找汉尼拔·周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Hannibal chau.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.64,0:56:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.21,0:56:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,找汉尼拔·周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannibal chau, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.74,0:56:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.39,0:56:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.36,0:56:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天 这地方简直就是天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, this place is heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.42,0:57:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那是第二代怪兽的淋巴结\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lymph gland from a category 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.69,0:57:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are you working on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.06,0:57:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是角质层吗 崭新的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a cuticle? In mint condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.73,0:57:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那是怪兽寄生虫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a kaiju skin parasite?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.33,0:57:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前从没见过活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen them alive before!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.37,0:57:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽倒下 它们就会跟着死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They-they usually die as soon as the kaiju falls!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.01,0:57:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为不可能养得活它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you couldn't keep them alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.57,0:57:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 泡在氨水里就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can if you soak 'em in ammonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.21,0:57:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.92,0:57:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我找汉尼拔·周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Hannibal chau.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.78,0:57:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有人告诉我他在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told he was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.55,0:57:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.02,0:57:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.23,0:57:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.96,0:57:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,斯达克·潘特考斯特将军让我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stacker pentecost sent me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.47,0:57:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.40,0:57:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,太爽了 真是爽到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's great. That's real great.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.80,0:57:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你就是汉尼拔·周 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I take it you're Hannibal chau, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.47,0:57:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢这名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.74,0:57:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,它取自于\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took it from, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.11,0:57:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的历史人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite historical character...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.88,0:57:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,和我第二喜欢的布鲁克林川菜馆的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my second-favorite szechuan restaurant in Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.21,0:57:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,老实交代 你想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now tell me what you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.08,0:58:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我把你当猪宰了喂怪兽身上的虱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I gut you like a pig and feed you to the skin louse.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.05,0:58:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子控制不了她的情感\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't control her drift,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.89,0:58:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那个罗利又先失准\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he went out of phase first!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.49,0:58:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.42,0:58:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能姑息错误 怪兽在不断升级\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't afford mistakes, the kaiju keep evolving,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.83,0:58:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经被打得屁滚尿流了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they keep kicking our asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.40,0:58:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那小子过气了 麻子就是个菜鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a has-been, she's a rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.10,0:58:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让这样的人掩护我运输炸弹 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want them protecting my bomb run, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.73,0:58:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,注意你的语气 查克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to watch your tone, Mr. Hansen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.30,0:58:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 待在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.84,0:58:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等我一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.18,0:58:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩丢人丢到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are a goddamn disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.65,0:58:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,听着罗利 你会让我们所有的人丧命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get us all killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.08,0:58:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还会毁了这里的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and here's the thing, Raleigh:
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.52,0:58:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我想执行完任务活着回来 因为我十分热爱我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to come back from this mission 'cause I quite like my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.62,0:58:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不如你就这样 帮大家一个忙 消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you just do us all a favor and disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.63,0:58:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你最擅长干这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing you're good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.03,0:58:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.93,0:58:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.80,0:58:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好管好你的小女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just hold back your little girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.63,0:58:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别让她跑出来乱咬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of you bitches needs a leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.01,0:59:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 向她道歉 - 去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Apologize to her. - Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.22,0:59:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.66,0:59:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.20,0:59:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了 快点儿向她道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saidapologize to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.84,0:59:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.04,0:59:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.54,0:59:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet, both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.68,0:59:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,贝克特 麻子 到我办公室来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becket, mori, into my office, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.49,0:59:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我跟你没完 - 你还没闹够\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, we aren't finished! - Hey! Hey! This is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.89,0:59:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个特种兵 看在老天的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a ranger, for chrissake.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.39,0:59:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能有点素质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you start acting like one?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.26,0:59:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是我先失的准 这一切都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went out of phase first. It was my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.60,0:59:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.74,1:00:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.54,1:00:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不应该安排你们俩做搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have never let you two in the same machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.54,1:00:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.04,1:00:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要雪藏我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're grounding us?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.45,1:00:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.75,1:00:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我提请退出任务 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission to be dismissed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.09,1:00:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,请求批准 麻子小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission granted, miss mori.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.80,1:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.24,1:00:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 为什么要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.71,1:00:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她是眼下最佳的副驾驶人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is the strongest candidate by far.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.65,1:00:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有别的选择吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What other options do we have?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.45,1:00:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.98,1:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你不要再挑战我的忍耐底线了 我的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let my calm demeanor fool you, ranger!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.29,1:00:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不服从上级 对你真的没有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is not a good moment for your insubordination!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.89,1:00:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子缺乏经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako is too inexperienced...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.73,1:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在作战中无法控制好自己的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}to rein in her memories during combat.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.56,1:01:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你雪藏她的理由 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not why you grounded her.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.23,1:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我进入过她的记忆 我都看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in her memories. I saw everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.90,1:01:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不管你自以为是的猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you think you saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.85,1:03:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道她对你的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what she means to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.02,1:03:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it! I...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.62,1:03:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.19,1:03:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这次谈话到此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This conversation is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.13,1:03:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.70,1:03:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 能不能停下 请你和我再聊两句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshal, can we just talk about this for one second? !
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.07,1:03:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你不但救了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rescued her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.10,1:03:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还养育了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You raised her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.77,1:03:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在不是在保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not protecting her now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.04,1:03:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在压制她的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are holding her back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.88,1:03:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,第一 以后千万别再碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}One: Don't you ever touch me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.55,1:03:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,第二 还是以后千万别再碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two: Don't you ever touch me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.22,1:03:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你 你根本不知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you have no idea who the hell I am...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.82,1:03:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,也根本不知道我的来历\N{\fnArial\fs30}or where I've come from,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.46,1:03:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我也绝对不会告诉你我的人生故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not about to tell you my whole life story.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.63,1:03:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有一点可以告诉你 对于你和这里的每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I need to be to you and everybody in this dome...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.56,1:03:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你们的上级\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a fixed point.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.57,1:03:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,会一直战斗到最后的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last man standing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.07,1:03:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要你的同情或者欣赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not need your sympathy or your admiration.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.67,1:03:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的是你的服从和作战技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I need is your compliance and your fighting skills.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.94,1:04:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你给不了我这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I can't get that,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.35,1:04:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就回到那个我找到你时\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you can go back to the wall...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.41,1:04:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你正在砌墙的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I found you crawling on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.28,1:04:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的够清楚了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.26,1:04:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.46,1:04:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.12,1:04:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.13,1:04:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我本应该提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've warned you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.33,1:04:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次通感会很惨烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}First drifts are rough.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.87,1:04:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你不仅仅是要进入我的回忆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you weren't just tapping into my memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.87,1:04:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会进入我哥哥的回忆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were tapping into my brother's too.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.74,1:05:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我哥哥被怪兽抓走的时候 我们还连接在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}When yancy was taken, we were still connected.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.31,1:05:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我感受到他的害怕 他的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt his fear, his pain,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.81,1:05:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,和无助 然后他就\N{\fnArial\fs30}his helplessness, and then...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.92,1:05:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,死去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.99,1:05:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我感受到了 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt it. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.42,1:05:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,长久以来待在一个人的记忆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you live in someone else's head for so long...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.43,1:05:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,很难适应这段记忆突然变得沉默\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hardest part to deal with is the silence.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.06,1:05:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 让另一个人真正进入你的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}To let someone else in, to really connect,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.83,1:05:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,需要足够的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to trust them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.84,1:05:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,今天咱俩通感信号很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}And today the drift was strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.71,1:05:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,它的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.45,1:05:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你上一次看见是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time you saw it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.95,1:05:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.09,1:05:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,往下拉 向左移动一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Movement in the breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.70,1:05:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,双重事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double event.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.37,1:06:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,两个信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two signatures.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.87,1:06:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,详细描述 第四代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dilation indicator, category 4.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.11,1:06:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.92,1:06:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,缺口在23点时被侵入\N{\fnArial\fs30}The breach was exposed at 2300 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.22,1:06:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到两个信号 都是第四代\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have two signatures, both category 4s.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.22,1:06:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的代号是大立和棱皮龟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code names: Otachi and leatherback.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.96,1:06:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一小时内就会到到达香港\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll reach Hong Kong within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.56,1:06:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,疏散全城市民 关闭大桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuate the city. Shut down the Bridges.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.83,1:06:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,每一个市民现在都必须马上去避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want every single civilian in a refuge right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.60,1:06:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,红色暴风 切尔诺贝利阿尔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crimson typhoon, cherno Alpha,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.67,1:06:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你们去保卫海港\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to frontline the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.47,1:06:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,守住大陆架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on the miracle mile.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.97,1:06:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,突袭者 你留后防守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Striker, I want you to stay back,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.97,1:06:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,保护海岸线\N{\fnArial\fs30}look after the coastline.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.41,1:06:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们绝不能失去你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot afford to lose you,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.01,1:06:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不到万不得已不要出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}so only engage as a final option.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.01,1:06:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.14,1:06:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.14,1:06:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,原地待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay put.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.01,1:06:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.70,1:07:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,劳森特中心 突袭者开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loccent, striker's got the ball and we're on the roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.74,1:07:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,中心 即将就位 等待命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loccent...Near positions and awaiting your orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.77,1:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,待在一英里大陆架 不要轻易动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remain in the miracle mile. Engage at your discretion.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.18,1:07:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 大家都提高警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.98,1:07:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这第四代无论是体型还是重量\N{\fnArial\fs30}These category 4s are the biggest we've ever seen,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.15,1:07:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我们见过最大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}both in size and weight.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.62,1:07:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,切尔诺阿尔法到达目标区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cherno Alpha reaching target zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.35,1:07:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,准备脱离运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disengaging transport.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.37,1:07:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,切尔诺阿尔法已经就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cherno Alpha in position. Miracle mile.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.64,1:07:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,切尔诺阿尔法掌控海岸线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cherno Alpha holding the coastline.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.88,1:07:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beacon is on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.69,1:08:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,看看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.56,1:08:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们相信怪兽是上天派来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They believe the kaiju are sent from heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.00,1:08:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝以此表达他对我们所做所为的不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the gods are expressing their displeasure with our behavior.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.40,1:08:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,愚昧的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The silly bastards.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.70,1:08:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你信仰什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you believe?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.37,1:08:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.00,1:08:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我信仰怪兽骨粉能卖到500美元一磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that kaiju bone powder is 500 bucks a pound.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.67,1:08:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.94,1:08:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要研究一个怪兽的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to access a kaiju brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.34,1:08:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,完好无损的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Completely intact.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.71,1:08:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.71,1:08:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的颅骨板很稠密\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skull plate is so dense...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.95,1:08:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,等你钻进去之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}that by the time you drill into it...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.08,1:08:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,大脑已经腐烂光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the brain's rotted away.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.38,1:08:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是次级大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm talking about the secondary brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.35,1:08:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你我都知道怪兽的体积超大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we both know that the kaiju are so large...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.35,1:08:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,它们需要两个大脑才能走路 跟恐龙一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}they need two brains to move around, like a dinosaur.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.72,1:08:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想弄到那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to get my hands on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.26,1:08:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.03,1:08:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你要个次级大脑干什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you want a secondary brain for, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.43,1:08:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽身上每个部分都能卖钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, every part of the kaiju sells.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.97,1:08:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,软骨 脾脏 肝脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cartilage, spleen, liver.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.40,1:08:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至是粪便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the crap!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.63,1:08:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,每立方米的粪便含有大量的磷\N{\fnArial\fs30}One cubic meter of crap...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.24,1:08:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可以用来给整片农田施肥\N{\fnArial\fs30}has enough phosphorous in it to fertilize a whole field!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.21,1:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但是大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the brain...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.11,1:08:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,全是氨水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much ammonia.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.91,1:09:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你要它干嘛 小兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the deal, little fella?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.28,1:09:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's classified.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.71,1:09:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能跟你说 打死都不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I couldn't tell you. Even if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.28,1:09:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.08,1:09:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的活儿还真挺酷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.99,1:09:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你说说也没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I might tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.82,1:09:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.59,1:09:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到办法和怪兽实现通感了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured out how to drift with a kaiju.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.16,1:09:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你在耍我 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you funnin' me, son?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.63,1:09:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,搞清它们的头脑太有意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fascinating how their minds work.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.17,1:09:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,每个独立的怪兽 它的头脑都被连接了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single kaiju, his mind's connected.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.90,1:09:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这个物种好像 好像是蜂群式思维\N{\fnArial\fs30}The species has like a... like a hive mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.81,1:09:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.48,1:09:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的实现过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gone and done it, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.68,1:09:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就一小会儿而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it a little bit, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.92,1:09:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个该死的白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You goddamn moron.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.46,1:09:54.38,Note,,0,0,0,,移动右边 三点钟
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.96,1:09:55.93,Note,,0,0,0,,三点钟
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.28,1:10:16.08,Note,,0,0,0,,雷云准备 出击
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.88,1:11:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,中心 暴风和阿尔法有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loccent! Typhoon and Alpha are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.52,1:11:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去解围\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're movin' in!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.95,1:11:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,待在位置上 你们不准出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to hold your ground. Do not engage.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.92,1:11:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你们携带核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you to carry that bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.59,1:11:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.76,1:11:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能眼看着他们被打死 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, we can't just sit here and watch 'em die. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.80,1:11:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,顾不了这些了 中心 我们现在出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, screw this. Loccent, we're movin' in now!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.87,1:11:55.38,Note,,0,0,0,,红色暴风完了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.50,1:11:57.71,Note,,0,0,0,,我们来干掉这个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.14,1:12:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,切尔诺阿尔法报告 我们被某种强酸击中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cherno Alpha, we've been hit with some type of acid!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.24,1:12:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.31,1:12:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,外壳彻底破损 我们需要支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hull has been compromised. We need backup immediately!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.28,1:12:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 我们马上过去支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold on, cherno! We're on our way!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.18,1:12:47.58,Note,,0,0,0,,水位已经到达反应堆
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.38,1:12:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,用尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our power move! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.80,1:13:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,和阿尔法失去联络 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just lost cherno, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.87,1:13:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,启动地对空导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engaging air missiles!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.76,1:14:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么事 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.80,1:14:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,冲击波 干扰了机甲战士的电路\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blast. It jumbled all the jaegers' electrical circuits.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.37,1:14:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.03,1:14:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,中心 我以前从来没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loccent! I've never seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.30,1:14:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,中心 它们进化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loccent! They're adapting.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.37,1:14:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是防御机制 是武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a defense mechanism, it's a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.11,1:14:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,联络突袭者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me striker!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.61,1:14:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没反应 长官 五号机甲数字接口被毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, sir. The mark 5's digital's fried.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.14,1:14:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要两个小时重置辅助系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take me two hours to reroute the auxiliary.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.58,1:14:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,所有机甲都是数控的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the jaegers, they're digital!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.31,1:14:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不都是 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of them, marshal.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.58,1:14:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,流浪者是模拟机 核控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy's analog. Nuclear.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.83,1:14:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,两头怪兽袭击我们 我们得撤离 这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got two kaijus. We gotta get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.90,1:14:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一会儿 劳驾 发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on a second. Excuse me. Wh-what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.77,1:15:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有两头该死的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two goddamn kaiju...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.10,1:15:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,直接冲着香港过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}headed straight for Hong Kong city.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.97,1:15:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这不可能 以前从来没有两个一起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. That's not possible. There's never been two before.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.91,1:15:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 没准儿是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe that's 'cause...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.44,1:15:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,以前没人跟它们通感过 大天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}nobody ever drifted with one before, eh, genius? !
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.45,1:15:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,机甲驾驶员的通感 是双向的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When jaeger pilots drift, it's a two-way street.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.42,1:15:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 通过桥接 对吧 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A bridge, right? - Of course. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.48,1:15:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,架起一种关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sets up a connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.55,1:15:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,双向关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both ways!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.59,1:15:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂群式思维 是你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A hive mentality," you said!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.52,1:15:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,或许那些怪兽 它们是在寻找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe those kaiju are tryin' to find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.16,1:15:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们 我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What... what're we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.03,1:15:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去我自己的怪兽避难所躲过这一劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna wait out this shitstorm in my own private kaiju bunker.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.00,1:15:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你 得去公共避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are going to a public refuge.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.47,1:15:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我去过那儿一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried it once. Once.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.42,1:15:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.80,1:15:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get the hell outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.74,1:16:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 让一让\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.38,1:16:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.25,1:16:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.42,1:16:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,让开 我是医生 我是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! I'm a doctor! I'm a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.06,1:16:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold on. Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.37,1:16:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 让我进去 我是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm a doctor. Okay, let me in, I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.50,1:16:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,请您立即进入避难所避难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please proceed immediately to your anti-kaiju refuge.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.03,1:17:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没有应急电力供应\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no emergency power.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.69,1:17:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 必须撤离 - 让我再想想别的法子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta bail. - I'm gonna try somethin' else.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.13,1:17:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别解除驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Don't disengage!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.56,1:17:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! My arm!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.87,1:17:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,起来 快站起来 老头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Come on! Get on your feet, old man!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.44,1:17:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 别这么叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.81,1:17:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,它就在外面 我们必须马上离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right outside. We gotta get outta here now!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.58,1:17:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们哪儿也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not goin' anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.05,1:17:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,眼下只有你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you and I are the only thing...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.48,1:17:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,挡在这个丑八怪和整个城市的\N{\fnArial\fs30}standin' between that ugly bastard...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.99,1:17:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,千万条人命中间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a city of 2 million people.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.55,1:17:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们要做出抉择 是坐在这里等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we have a choice here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.76,1:17:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们要做出抉择 是坐在这里等\N{\fnArial\fs30}We either sit and wait...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.79,1:17:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还是用这些信号枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we take these flare guns...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.13,1:17:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,孤注一掷地跟它拼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do something really stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.51,1:17:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的胳膊怎么样 - 把枪给我就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's your arm? - Ah, just give me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.44,1:17:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.66,1:18:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们激怒它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we just pissed it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.38,1:18:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好了吗 麻子 做好准备 这是实战\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, mako. Get ready, this is for real!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.66,1:18:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.73,1:18:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 流浪者 狠狠地打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, gipsy! Kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.25,1:19:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 准备好了吗 一起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's do this! Together!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.97,1:20:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,天马流星拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elbow rocket!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.97,1:20:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,天马流星拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elbow rocket!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.37,1:20:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,出拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.29,1:20:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.61,1:20:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, mako!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.70,1:21:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等离子榴弹炮 发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plasma Cannon, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.30,1:21:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等离子榴弹炮准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plasma Cannon engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.54,1:21:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,全部打光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Empty the clip!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.98,1:21:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,全部打光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Empty the clip!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.81,1:21:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.75,1:21:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我想那家伙应该是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this guy's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.15,1:21:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最好再检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's check for a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.82,1:22:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.37,1:22:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,检查完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.56,1:22:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,它在上面停下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stopped right above us.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.87,1:22:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.63,1:22:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不是避难所 这里是餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a refuge. This is... this is a buffet line!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.31,1:22:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,它知道我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.21,1:22:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,它知道我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.81,1:22:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,它知道我们都在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows we're all here!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.31,1:22:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白 它要抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't understand, he's trying to get me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.22,1:23:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,它一定知道我在这儿 它要抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows I'm here and he's trying to get me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.70,1:23:02.21,Note,,0,0,0,,它 它是要他的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.28,1:23:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that? What did you say? !
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.25,1:23:04.70,Note,,0,0,0,,怪兽要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.72,1:23:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,让我出去 让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get out of here! Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.22,1:23:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我要… 啊 我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got... Ah, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.16,1:23:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were expensive glasses.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.16,1:23:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真是糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the worst.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.30,1:24:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,转矩准备完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torque engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.56,1:25:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,无法精确定位 它动作太快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't pinpoint it. It's movin' quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.76,1:25:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要提高警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.86,1:25:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,直升机 你能传给我图像吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choppers, do you have a visual? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.01,1:26:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.77,1:26:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我来制住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.17,1:26:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,打开左翼冷却剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vent the coolant on the left flank!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.71,1:26:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,冷却剂打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coolant venting.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.11,1:26:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,已经打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venting coolant.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.34,1:27:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,上升过程氧气流失中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atmosphere loss in progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.74,1:27:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,温度下降 我们的氧气不够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temperature's droppin'! We're losing oxygen!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.28,1:27:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,两枚等离子榴弹炮已发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both plasma cannons are shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.75,1:27:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无计可施了 麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of options, mako.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.88,1:28:01.11,Note,,0,0,0,,不 还有一个办法
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.35,1:28:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,准备亮剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sword deployment.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.98,1:28:13.86,Note,,0,0,0,,为了我的家人
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.31,1:28:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,海拔驱动装置 失去平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Altitude actuation off-balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.54,1:28:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,距离地面还有5万英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}50, 000 feet to ground contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.28,1:28:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,看 在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.32,1:28:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,海拔驱动装置 失去平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Altitude loss critical.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.82,1:28:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,4万英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}40, 000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.16,1:28:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,流浪者 听我命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.56,1:28:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,松开所有减震器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loosen all the shock absorbers,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.30,1:28:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,用陀螺仪平衡身体 蜷缩抱团\N{\fnArial\fs30}use your gyroscope as balance and ball up!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.57,1:28:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your only chance!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.47,1:28:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,2万英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}20, 000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.91,1:28:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,丢掉燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel purge!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.67,1:28:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.01,1:29:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,撞击警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impact alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.31,1:29:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们下降速度太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're comin' in too fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.08,1:29:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,速度太快 准备好 麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're comin' in too fast. Brace for impact, ma...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.28,1:29:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子 说句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.85,1:29:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.15,1:29:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.06,1:29:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.57,1:30:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马上去找葛斯勒博士 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go to Dr. geiszler now! - Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.34,1:30:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要剩下的两个机甲战士全面恢复各项功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the two remaining jaegers back to 100% functionality.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.34,1:30:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.68,1:30:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要得到皮肤 爪子和翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna harvest the skin, the talons and the wing.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.65,1:30:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,德国人看到一定会乐疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Germans are gonna go nuts for that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.89,1:30:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来看看地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that map.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.69,1:30:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是怪兽倒下的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is where the kaiju fell,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.39,1:30:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就集中精力在这里动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}here's where we concentrate our efforts.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.83,1:30:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去搞定 老大 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll get it, boss. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.56,1:30:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.36,1:30:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,看看谁回来了 你这个白痴独眼龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guess who's back, you one-eyed bitch?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.27,1:30:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你欠我一个怪兽大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you owe me a kaiju brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.25,1:30:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,罗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raleigh!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.72,1:30:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我那臭小子不会认输\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kid'd never admit it...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.09,1:30:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但他很感激你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.23,1:31:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both are.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.70,1:31:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,贝克特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. becket!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.90,1:31:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss mori!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.97,1:31:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在我毕生的戎马生涯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all of my years fighting...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.14,1:31:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,从没见过 了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.98,1:31:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.22,1:31:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.29,1:31:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,为所有人骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proud of us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.72,1:31:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.59,1:31:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别怪我不近人情 我们还没有时间庆祝胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}As harsh as it sounds, there is no time to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.23,1:31:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去了两组队友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost two crews.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.27,1:31:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没时间难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time to grieve.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.41,1:31:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,重置战事钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reset that clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.19,1:32:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,重置战事钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reset the clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.82,1:32:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信你居然利用我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still can't believe what you did to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.89,1:32:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点被活吞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I coulda been eaten.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.46,1:32:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,要的就是这个效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was definitely the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.30,1:32:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,算你走运 就这么躲过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for you, that didn't become necessary, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.70,1:32:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢 你真是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thank you so much. You're so kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.47,1:32:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我简直受宠若惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really appreciate all of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.14,1:32:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你能不能告诉我 为什么你的手下取个大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now do you mind tellin' me exactly what is taking so long...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.37,1:32:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要花那么长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your workers to get that brain?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.91,1:32:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们 先得往里面灌二氧化碳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they pump the cavity full of co2,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.01,1:32:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就像做腹腔镜手术那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like in any other laparoscopic surgery.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.34,1:32:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这倒是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yes, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.91,1:32:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 二氧化碳会延缓酸性反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}the co2's gonna delay the acidic reaction, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.58,1:33:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 这样才能取材\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it allows us to harvest.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.35,1:33:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我手下的工作服里注满氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our boys need oxygen pumped into their suits.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.15,1:33:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,行动就会缓慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They move slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.39,1:33:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那边怎么样了 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's goin' on in there, boys?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.19,1:33:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've reached...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.26,1:33:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,上骨盆地带了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The upper pelvic area.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.89,1:33:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,正去往第25节椎骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving to the 25th vertebra.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.10,1:33:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.77,1:33:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,正在穿越它的内脏 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even through the suit, boss,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.90,1:33:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿闻起来一股臭猫烂鱼味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}it smells like dead catfish in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.27,1:33:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.21,1:33:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,次级大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The secondary brain...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.25,1:33:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 损坏了 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is damage. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.38,1:33:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没用了 已经毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ruin. Destroy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.71,1:33:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真是见鬼 这些办事不力的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch! How could they screw that up? !
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.35,1:33:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.58,1:33:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.02,1:33:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他说等等 等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say "wait"? Why wait?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.22,1:33:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.69,1:33:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,像是心跳声\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.89,1:33:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.20,1:33:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, this can't be. Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.40,1:33:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,把对讲机给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Let me have that!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.20,1:33:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别吵 别吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, shh! Listen, listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.10,1:33:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.98,1:34:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,它怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.14,1:35:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,别别别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.67,1:35:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.34,1:35:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.52,1:35:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.33,1:35:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.86,1:35:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.33,1:35:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,它的肺还没发育完全\N{\fnArial\fs30}His lungs weren't fully formed.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.33,1:35:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,脐带缠住了它的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umbilical cord tied around his neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.74,1:35:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在子宫外它连一分钟也活不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way he could survive outside the womb for more than a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.01,1:35:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我一只眼 而且只看一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}One look, that's all I needed.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.04,1:35:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就知道它活不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew he wouldn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.52,1:35:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,丑八怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugly little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.66,1:35:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 我都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I woulda...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.24,1:36:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你的病有多严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}How sick are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.91,1:36:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不早告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.88,1:36:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's to tell?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.38,1:36:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道那些一代机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, them mark 1s,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.38,1:36:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们仅仅花了14个月 就把那些臭小子制造出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we scraped them bad boys together in 14 months.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.96,1:37:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那会儿我们根本就没有考虑过屏蔽辐射的措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last thing we were thinking about was radiation shielding.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.83,1:37:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我身上扛着十几项任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran nearly a dozen missions.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.33,1:37:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,医学雷达却从没检测出我有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stayed under the medical radar for awhile...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.27,1:37:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我最后一次在东京驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the last time I jockeyed was Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.64,1:37:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,当时我独自战斗了三个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finished the fight solo, but for three hours...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.14,1:37:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我有了反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I burned.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.18,1:37:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们警告过我 如果再进入机甲参加战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They warned me if I ever stepped foot into a jaeger again,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.11,1:37:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,将会付出巨大代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}the toll would be too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.15,1:37:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我是唯一两个能单独操作机甲的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are the only two that ever ran solo combat.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.32,1:37:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我找你回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.33,1:37:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么事 - 果然发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Sir, it's happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.43,1:37:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚收到两条信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got two signatures...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.94,1:37:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,空前强烈 足有40米高\N{\fnArial\fs30}with unprecedented dilation, 40-meter spikes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.61,1:37:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,第几代的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What category?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.97,1:37:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,正在核对比率 是第四代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checking the ratios, category four.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.64,1:37:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where're they headed?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.31,1:37:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,问题就在这儿 它们没有设定任何方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the thing, they're not headin' anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.18,1:37:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在缺口上方盘旋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hovering just above the breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.28,1:38:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像在保护什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's...it's like they're protecting it or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.35,1:38:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,通知流浪者 突袭者 准备出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, gipsy, striker, on deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.82,1:38:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 赫克无法驾驶 他的手臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, herc cannot ride. His arm...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.22,1:38:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,执行命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.02,1:38:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,两条信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two signatures.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.33,1:38:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,两条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two? ! There are...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.29,1:38:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你说缺口处有两条怪兽信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are two kaiju signatures in the breach,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.56,1:38:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我之前猜测的三条吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}not three like I predicted? !
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.30,1:38:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,赫尔曼 我今天心情非常不好 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hermann! I haven't exactly had a very good day, okay? !
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.80,1:38:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有5分钟时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got about 5 minutes...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.57,1:38:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be three kaijus.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.84,1:38:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不然怪兽大脑就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before brain death occurs here!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.54,1:38:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想浪费时间讨论你的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna spend it talking about your theories!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.04,1:38:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,情况不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.64,1:38:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,应该有三只怪兽过来 绝不止两只\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should be three kaijus coming through, not two!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.98,1:38:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,应该三只却来了两只\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should be three and there's two?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.48,1:38:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 犯错误是痛苦的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, it hurts to be wrong, doesn't it, hermann?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.65,1:38:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我没犯错 只是有些东西没搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not wrong, but there is something here that we don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.22,1:38:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你在预测模型里犯下的种种错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Hermann, hopefully we can argue about any mistakes...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.02,1:38:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会探讨\N{\fnArial\fs30}you made in your predictive model in the future!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.82,1:38:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.09,1:38:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,神经接口值超出了正常范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}the neural interface is way off the charts!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.36,1:38:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,如果想帮忙 就别废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to help, help with that!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.66,1:38:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,纽顿 我绝对不会错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newton, I am not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.66,1:38:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一种办法能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only one way to make sure...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.53,1:38:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is to do this...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.27,1:38:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,一起干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.87,1:38:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你一起做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.40,1:38:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,机甲战士驾驶员不是两个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the jaeger pilots do,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.34,1:38:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,分担神经性负荷\N{\fnArial\fs30}share the neural load.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.21,1:39:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你说真的 真愿意为我这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious? You...you would do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.01,1:39:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你说真愿意跟我试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you would do that with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.61,1:39:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,地球已经到了最危急的时刻 只要有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, with worldwide destruction a certain alternative...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.28,1:39:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我就没有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I really have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.02,1:39:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起来发誓 我们来主宰这个坏小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then say it with me, my man: "We're gonna own this bad boy!"
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.12,1:39:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,苍天在上 我们誓将搞清一切 主宰一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}By jove, we are going to own this thing for sure!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.20,1:39:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,天童 天童\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi, tendo. Tendo!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.60,1:39:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没穿好装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not suited up.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.94,1:39:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm aware of that, Elvis.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.71,1:39:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.44,1:39:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,让你穿好 你就穿好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said suit up, so suit up.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.08,1:39:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我总不能一个人驾驶突袭者吧 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tendo, I can't pilot striker on my own, now, can I? !
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.05,1:39:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸受伤了 谁来做我的副驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's hurt, so who's gonna be my copilot?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.30,1:40:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,以前没感觉这么紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember it being so tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.57,1:40:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,回到机甲体内作战会要了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting back into that jaeger will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.78,1:40:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不回去所有人都会没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gettin' into one would kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.15,1:40:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你是个勇敢的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you are a brave girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.99,1:40:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,能看着你长大那是我的幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so lucky to have seen you grow.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.09,1:40:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我决定我这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I'm going to do this...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.76,1:40:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我还需要你保护我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.04,1:40:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.64,1:40:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.11,1:40:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人 听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.69,1:40:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.06,1:41:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.03,1:41:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的最后希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the edge of our hope...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.90,1:41:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的最后一刻生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of our time...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.34,1:41:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不仅仅选择了相信自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have chosen not only to believe in ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.31,1:41:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还选择了相信彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.48,1:41:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,今天站在这里的不论是男人还是女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today there's not a man nor woman in here...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.25,1:41:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,都不是孤军奋战\N{\fnArial\fs30}that shall stand alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.85,1:41:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就在今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not today.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.69,1:41:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我们将直面入侵我们家园的魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we face the monsters that are at our door...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.92,1:41:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,将和它们决一死战\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bring the fight to them!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.53,1:41:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我们要推翻启示录的末日预言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we are canceling the apocalypse!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.88,1:41:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,马上进入安全区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the safety zone right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.38,1:41:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, marshal!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.89,1:41:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才你讲得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that was a great speech,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.46,1:42:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but how exactly are you and I...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.72,1:42:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我怎么实现通感\N{\fnArial\fs30}supposed to match up in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.26,1:42:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,通感时我会心无旁骛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I carry nothing into the drift.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.93,1:42:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没有回忆 没有恐惧 没有军阶\N{\fnArial\fs30}No memories, no fear. No rank.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.47,1:42:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,至于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as for you...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.77,1:42:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,再简单不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.04,1:42:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你傲慢任性 还跟你老爸有矛盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an egotistical jerk with daddy issues.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.74,1:42:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,第一天见到你 我就看透你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple puzzle I solved on day one.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.98,1:42:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但你毕竟有你老爸的血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are your father's son...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.74,1:42:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的通感应该很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll drift just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.78,1:42:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.60,1:42:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.64,1:42:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,当你跟人通感了以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you drift with someone,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.14,1:42:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会觉得没必要再交谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you feel like there's nothing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.35,1:43:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不想憋着话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't want to regret...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.18,1:43:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,等着今后没法说再后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the things that I never said out loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.52,1:43:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.92,1:43:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用说出来 不用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.36,1:43:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.43,1:43:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always have.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.13,1:43:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.44,1:43:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我会想你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.18,1:43:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,替我好好照顾它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look after him for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.95,1:43:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stacker.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.69,1:43:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你并肩作战的可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my son you got there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.29,1:43:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.23,1:43:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 麻子 这些年我一直活在过去的阴影里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, mako, all those years I spent livin' in the past,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.97,1:43:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,从来没有想过人生和未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never really thought about the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.54,1:44:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但是此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until now.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.25,1:44:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是我人生中最好的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never did have very good timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.07,1:44:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.40,1:44:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.77,1:44:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,神经元连线启动 倒数5秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiating neural handshake in 5...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.01,1:44:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,4 3 2 1\N{\fnArial\fs30}4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.27,1:45:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.37,1:45:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.37,1:45:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm completely fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.61,1:45:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,通感 你看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drift. You saw it?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.45,1:45:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.72,1:45:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们得警告他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we have to warn them.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.49,1:45:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,机甲战士 缺口 还有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jaegers... the breach... the plan...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.79,1:45:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那计划不可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.33,1:45:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,运输脱离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disengaging transport.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.47,1:45:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,中心 所有端口封闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loccent, all ports sealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.47,1:45:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,准备下潜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to submerge.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.14,1:45:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,所有端口封闭 准备下潜\N{\fnArial\fs30}All ports sealed. Ready to submerge.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.75,1:45:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,双方神经元连接吻合率100%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man: Both neural handshakes at 100%.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.82,1:45:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,神经元连接确认 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neural handshake confirmed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.49,1:45:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,关岛海域附近 两头怪兽仍处于环形阵势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two actives still in circle formation in the Guam quadrant.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.36,1:46:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的代号是恶灵 雷兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code names: Scunner, raiju.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.93,1:46:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 都是四代怪兽 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Both category 4. - Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.17,1:46:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,离海崖还有半英里 准备跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half a mile to the ocean cliff, we jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.84,1:46:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,缺口还有3公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 3, 000 meters to the breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.10,1:46:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,半英里 可我连前方半英寸都看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half a mile? ! I can't even see a damn inch ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.64,1:46:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么扔下这枚核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we supposed to deliver the bomb?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.51,1:46:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,能见度为零\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visibility's zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.05,1:46:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,现在转为自动导航\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switching to instruments now.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.86,1:46:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.69,1:46:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,流浪者 你的右侧有动静 三点方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy, you have movement on your right. Three o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.06,1:46:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,三点方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.40,1:46:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,半径100英尺 安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 feet radius, clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.20,1:46:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,右翼安全 没有敌情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right flank's clear. I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.20,1:46:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是左翼 速度飞快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left now! And movin' fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.67,1:46:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,打破了怪兽的最快纪录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fastest kaiju on record!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.01,1:46:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都看不见 它移动得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anything. It's movin' too fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.68,1:46:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,盯紧敌人 流浪者 还有600米就到缺口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes on the prize, gipsy. 600 meters from the drop.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.24,1:47:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,400米 越来越近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}400 meters and closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.54,1:47:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽停下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bogeys are stopping.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.72,1:47:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,突袭者 怪兽停下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Striker! Bogeys are stopping.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.88,1:47:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一点钟方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}One o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.12,1:47:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshal, what are you doing? !
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.19,1:47:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,它们停下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're stopping.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.36,1:47:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么停下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell are they stopping? !
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.12,1:47:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不管呢 将军 我们离下落点只有300米了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a damn, sir! We're 300 meters from the jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.26,1:47:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有问题 突袭者 怪兽没有跟上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's not right! Herc: Striker, the bogeys aren't following.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.13,1:47:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可以跳下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the leap now!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.96,1:47:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别 计划不可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it! Don't do it, it's not gonna work!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.57,1:47:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开 白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, you fascist!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.20,1:47:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,炸掉缺口的计划不可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blowing up the breach, it's not gonna work!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.87,1:47:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思 为什么不可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? What's not gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.20,1:47:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,缺口张开并不意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, just because the breach is open...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.97,1:47:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你的核弹能顺利穿过\N{\fnArial\fs30}does not mean you're gonna be able to get a bomb through.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.74,1:47:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,缺口原本就能读取怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The breach genetically reads the kaiju...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.71,1:47:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好比超市里的收款根据货品条码完成 这样才能顺利完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a barcode at the supermarket and then lets them pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.21,1:47:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你得设法让缺口误以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so you're gonna have to fool the breach...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.65,1:47:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟怪兽有一样的条形码\N{\fnArial\fs30}into thinking that you have the same code!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.91,1:48:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么才能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are we supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.55,1:48:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,得让它认为你也是一头怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}By making it think you are a kaiju.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.12,1:48:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须攀附在怪兽身上驶入缺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to lock onto the kaiju, ride it into the breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.59,1:48:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,T缺口就会将你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He throat will then read...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.95,1:48:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,读取为怪兽 让你通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}the kaiju's genetic code and let you pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.89,1:48:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不这么做 核弹会跟以往一样射偏\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't do it, the bomb will deflect off the breach...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.39,1:48:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,任务就失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}like it always has and the mission will fail.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.49,1:48:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 现在你听了这么多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now that you've heard all that,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.73,1:48:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,想办法跳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}striker, take the leap!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.40,1:48:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 收到从缺口发出的第三个信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir! I have a third signature emerging from the breach!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.77,1:48:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,第三个信号从缺口发出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third signature emerging from the breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.60,1:48:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,三重攻势\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a triple event.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.07,1:48:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, I was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.40,1:48:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西有多大 是第几代\N{\fnArial\fs30}How big is it? What category?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.94,1:48:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是第五代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Category 5.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.18,1:48:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,突袭者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Striker,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.34,1:48:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是第五代怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a category 5.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.18,1:48:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是第一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.00,1:48:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,突袭者 我们看到它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Striker, we see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.67,1:49:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就在你后方100米处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're right behind you, about 100 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.88,1:49:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会包抄你的三点方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna come around your three o'clock,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.18,1:49:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,从侧面进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}try to flank him.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.51,1:49:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,标准两队阵型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard two-team formation.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.95,1:49:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你先控制它一会儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep him busy for a few mi...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.16,1:49:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,抵御冲击\N{\fnArial\fs30}brace for impact!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.64,1:49:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,准备亮剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chain sword deployed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.50,1:49:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧 你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.29,1:50:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,流浪者 你12点方向有敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy, comin' up on your 12 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.79,1:50:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,全速来袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full speed!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.62,1:50:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,快点躲避\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.04,1:50:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,投弹装置卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The release is jammed!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.31,1:50:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法投弹 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't deliver the payload, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.92,1:50:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的武器还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still armed.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.25,1:50:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但机甲外壳受损\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the hull is compromised!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.22,1:50:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一半的系统停滞 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half our systems are offline, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.76,1:50:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要重新…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to override the...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.56,1:51:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.60,1:51:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,两只怪兽向突袭者快速逼近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both kaijus converging on striker fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.68,1:51:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,挺住啊 突袭者 我们来支援你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, striker! We're comin' to ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.11,1:51:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不 流浪者 不要过来支援我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Gipsy! Do not come to our aid!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.68,1:51:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听到没有 - 坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you copy? - Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.15,1:51:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,离我们越远越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay as far back as you can!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.55,1:51:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以帮到你 我们朝你们过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can still reach you. We're comin' for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.95,1:52:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不 罗利 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Raleigh, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.36,1:52:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你很明白你该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know exactly what you have to do!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.36,1:52:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,流浪者是核能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy is nuclear!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.73,1:52:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把她带到缺口那儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to the breach!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.56,1:52:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我听见了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.03,1:52:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,朝缺口方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headin' for the breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.70,1:52:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,结构损伤 前进80%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Structural damage, 80%. Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.13,1:52:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.87,1:52:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你能完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.74,1:52:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远都在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll always be here for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.58,1:52:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远都会在通感里见到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can always find me in the drift.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.59,1:52:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一个活动核反应堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a walking nuclear reactor.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.26,1:52:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定会炸毁缺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can destroy the breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.04,1:52:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,下一步怎么做 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can we do, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.87,1:52:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们做一回清道夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can clear a path!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.01,1:52:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,给他们开路\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the lady!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.61,1:52:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是想要引爆核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna detonate the payload.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.71,1:53:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我老爸总说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my father always said:
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.52,1:53:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,把握机会 永不言悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said if you have the shot, you take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.45,1:53:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.86,1:53:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我很荣幸 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a pleasure, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.55,1:53:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.55,1:53:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我会想你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aishitemasu.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.92,1:54:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所有系统 陷入危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}All systems critical.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.69,1:54:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,机体失去平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fluid loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.52,1:54:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,系统陷入危机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Systems are critical!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.69,1:54:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,燃料泄漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel is leaking!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.59,1:54:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的右腿受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our right leg's crippled!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.66,1:54:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,红色警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code red.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.13,1:54:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们拼了 - 所有系统 陷入危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's finish this. - All systems critical.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.46,1:54:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.60,1:54:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,完成最终的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finishing the mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.33,1:54:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,中心 我们获取了怪兽残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loccent. We have the kaiju carcass.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.64,1:54:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在向缺口行进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're heading for the breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.51,1:54:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你们最好是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys better be right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.64,1:54:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,因为无论如何 我们都要完成这个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause one way or another, we're gettin' this thing done.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.66,1:54:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,听我倒数 启动喷射\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my count, rear jets!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.40,1:54:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.53,1:54:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.31,1:55:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,抱紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.49,1:55:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子小姐的氧气快用完了 不到一半了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako's oxygen is down. Half capacity!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.49,1:55:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,能启动备用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you reroute it?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.53,1:55:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在试 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tryin', sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.16,1:55:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 坚持住 麻子 - 热能净化启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on, mako. - Heat shaft purge.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.93,1:55:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我要烧死你这个大混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna burn this son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.02,1:55:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.19,1:55:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in! It worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.70,1:56:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,机甲左半侧 氧气含量低 危险级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxygen main, left hemisphere, critical levels.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.47,1:56:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,15%功能可供运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operating at 15% capacity.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.08,1:56:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,10%功能可供运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}10% capacity.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.61,1:56:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,5%功能可供运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}5% capacity.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.88,1:56:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他把氧气给麻子小姐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's givin' her his oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.29,1:56:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,机甲右半侧 氧气含量低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right hemisphere oxygen...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.42,1:56:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay now, mako.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.89,1:56:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,危险级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Critical level.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.92,1:56:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.33,1:56:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的我一个人就可以完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can finish this alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.16,1:56:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,顺势下坠就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I have to do is fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.66,1:56:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这个谁都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone can fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.47,1:56:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,罗利 你的氧气含量已经逼近危险值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raleigh, your oxygen levels are critical now.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.24,1:56:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.94,1:56:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,开始进行堆芯熔化 马上弃船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start the core meltdown and get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.64,1:56:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.64,1:56:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,现在马上弃船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there now!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.92,1:57:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一号逃生舱已弹出 没有爆炸 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}One pod is ejected. No detonation, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.19,1:57:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,中心 如果还能听见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loccent, if you can still hear me,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.86,1:57:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在开始反应堆破坏程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm initiating reactor override now.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.83,1:57:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,手动激活程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manual activation required.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.63,1:57:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发生什么了 - 触发器离线\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's goin' on? ! - Trigger's offline!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.47,1:57:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他得手动完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to do it by hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.67,1:57:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.87,1:57:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,得马上启动自毁程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to self-destruct now.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.04,1:57:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,手动激活程序 发生故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manual activation required.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.19,1:57:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.37,1:57:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,手动制动开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manual override initiated.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.67,1:57:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,60秒后开始堆芯熔化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Core meltdown in t-minus 60.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.98,1:58:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,55秒后反应堆熔化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reactor meltdown in 55 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.18,1:58:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,50秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.42,1:58:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,逃生舱准备中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evac pod engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.46,1:58:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,5 4 3 2 1\N{\fnArial\fs30}5, 4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.57,1:58:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,反应堆燃料熔化开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reactor meltdown commence.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.91,1:59:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,正中目标 缺口已经塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Direct hit! The breach has collapsed!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.38,1:59:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,启动直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the choppers!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.98,1:59:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,马上启动直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the choppers now!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.50,1:59:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,看到一号逃生舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visuals on first pod.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.94,1:59:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,跟踪信号强烈 生命迹象平稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracking solid. Vital signs are good.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.35,1:59:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 二号逃生舱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, where's the second pod?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.82,1:59:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,正在追踪 没有发现生命迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tracking it, but I'm getting no vital signs.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.28,2:00:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我摸不到他的脉搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find his pulse.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.78,2:00:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像停止呼吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's breathing.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.28,2:00:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,能读到他的脉搏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you read his pulse?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.48,2:00:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有脉搏吗 - 罗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does he have a pulse? - Raleigh?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.22,2:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 罗利 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Raleigh? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.62,2:00:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子小姐 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.66,2:00:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是因为传感器出故障了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be the sensors are not working.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.16,2:00:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't be sure.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.69,2:00:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.86,2:00:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 别死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.96,2:00:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.90,2:00:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,别离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.83,2:00:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.87,2:00:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别死 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go. Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.64,2:00:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,再这样我就被你勒死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're squeezing me too tight.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.15,2:00:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我快要窒息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.27,2:01:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我是赫拉克勒斯·汉斯将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is marshal Hercules Hansen.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.44,2:01:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,缺口被封死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The breach is sealed.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.01,2:01:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,战事钟永远归零\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the clock!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.60,2:01:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,麻子小姐 罗利 我们获取到了你们的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako, Raleigh. We have your position.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.27,2:01:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,直升机正在途中 稍等一会儿就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The choppers are on their way. J-just hang on.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.55,2:01:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.88,2:01:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,收到请回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.09,2:02:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, guys?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.13,2:05:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我那该死的鞋在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my goddamn shoe?
